{"input_path": "input/ipas中級_科目2_大數據處理分析與應用_imgs/page_0042.png", "page_index": null, "page_count": null, "width": 2382, "height": 3368, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header", "block_content": "第三章 機率統計基礎", "block_bbox": [1558, 206, 2080, 261], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[1558.0, 206.0], [2080.0, 206.0], [2080.0, 261.0], [1558.0, 261.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "樣本數極不均衡時應採用 Welch 檢定。", "block_bbox": [533, 400, 1453, 464], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[533.0, 400.0], [1453.0, 400.0], [1453.0, 464.0], [533.0, 464.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "檢定僅說明「是否顯著不同」，不代表差異具實質效益。", "block_bbox": [534, 499, 1828, 564], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 499.0], [1828.0, 499.0], [1828.0, 564.0], [534.0, 564.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "成對樣本 t 檢定（Paired-samples t-test）", "block_bbox": [401, 600, 1328, 663], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[401.0, 600.0], [1328.0, 600.0], [1328.0, 663.0], [401.0, 663.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "a. 方法概述", "block_bbox": [469, 702, 751, 762], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[469.0, 702.0], [751.0, 702.0], [751.0, 762.0], [469.0, 762.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "成對樣本 t 檢定用於比較同一個體在兩種不同情況下的平均差異，或是兩個彼此對應的觀測值組合（如配對樣本）之差異。它的核心在於「差值」的統計推論，而非兩組平均數本身的獨立比較。", "block_bbox": [534, 800, 2082, 1066], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 800.0], [2082.0, 800.0], [2082.0, 1066.0], [534.0, 1066.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "常見應用包括：", "block_bbox": [536, 1102, 946, 1161], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[536.0, 1102.0], [946.0, 1102.0], [946.0, 1161.0], [536.0, 1161.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "○ 同一組人在治療前與治療後的測量（如血壓、成績）。", "block_bbox": [589, 1201, 1845, 1262], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[589.0, 1201.0], [1845.0, 1201.0], [1845.0, 1262.0], [589.0, 1262.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "○ 配對實驗設計中（如雙胞胎、一對一配對樣本）。", "block_bbox": [593, 1301, 1745, 1364], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[593.0, 1301.0], [1745.0, 1301.0], [1745.0, 1364.0], [593.0, 1364.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "產品改善前後的性能差異評估。", "block_bbox": [596, 1403, 1367, 1463], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[596.0, 1403.0], [1367.0, 1403.0], [1367.0, 1463.0], [596.0, 1463.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "b. 適用條件與前提假設", "block_bbox": [470, 1501, 1001, 1562], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[470.0, 1501.0], [1001.0, 1501.0], [1001.0, 1562.0], [470.0, 1562.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "資料為連續變數。", "block_bbox": [531, 1602, 997, 1662], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[531.0, 1602.0], [997.0, 1602.0], [997.0, 1662.0], [531.0, 1662.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "每對觀測值來自相同個體或相互配對樣本。", "block_bbox": [534, 1701, 1553, 1764], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 1701.0], [1553.0, 1701.0], [1553.0, 1764.0], [534.0, 1764.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "各對觀測值的差值（差異量）近似常態分布。", "block_bbox": [535, 1801, 1601, 1866], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[535.0, 1801.0], [1601.0, 1801.0], [1601.0, 1866.0], [535.0, 1866.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "樣本對之間彼此獨立。", "block_bbox": [533, 1901, 1094, 1963], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[533.0, 1901.0], [1094.0, 1901.0], [1094.0, 1963.0], [533.0, 1963.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "c. 假設設定", "block_bbox": [471, 2001, 752, 2063], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[471.0, 2001.0], [752.0, 2001.0], [752.0, 2063.0], [471.0, 2063.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "在成對樣本t檢定中，檢定的對象是兩次測量值之間的「差值」平均數，記為 $ \\mu d $。檢定目的在於判斷該差值是否與0有顯著差異。", "block_bbox": [534, 2101, 2081, 2264], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 2101.0], [2081.0, 2101.0], [2081.0, 2264.0], [534.0, 2264.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 虛無假設（H $ _{0} $）： $ \\mu d = 0 $", "block_bbox": [537, 2301, 1124, 2363], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[537.0, 2301.0], [1124.0, 2301.0], [1124.0, 2363.0], [537.0, 2363.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "表示兩次測量之間沒有平均差異，差值的期望為零。", "block_bbox": [591, 2403, 1754, 2464], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[591.0, 2403.0], [1754.0, 2403.0], [1754.0, 2464.0], [591.0, 2464.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 對立假設（H $ _{1} $）則依檢定方向分為三種情況：", "block_bbox": [535, 2501, 1602, 2564], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[535.0, 2501.0], [1602.0, 2501.0], [1602.0, 2564.0], [535.0, 2564.0]]}, {"block_label": "table", "block_content": "<table><tr><td>檢定類型</td><td>對立假設  $ H_{{1}} $</td><td>適用情境</td></tr><tr><td>雙尾檢定</td><td>$ \\mu d \\ne 0 $</td><td>檢查兩次測量之間是否有「任一方向」的差異</td></tr><tr><td>左尾檢定</td><td>$ \\mu d < 0 $</td><td>第二次測量結果顯著低於第一次，例如療效降低</td></tr><tr><td>右尾檢定</td><td>$ \\mu d > 0 $</td><td>第二次測量結果顯著高於第一次，例如成績進步</td></tr></table>", "block_bbox": [360, 2595, 2071, 2947], "block_id": 20, "block_order": null, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[360.0, 2595.0], [2071.0, 2595.0], [2071.0, 2947.0], [360.0, 2947.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "3-35", "block_bbox": [2100, 3188, 2198, 3232], "block_id": 21, "block_order": null, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[2100.0, 3188.0], [2198.0, 3188.0], [2198.0, 3232.0], [2100.0, 3232.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"input_path": null, "page_index": null, "boxes": [{"cls_id": 12, "label": "header", "score": 0.8721837997436523, "coordinate": [1558, 206, 2080, 261], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1558.0, 206.0], [2080.0, 206.0], [2080.0, 261.0], [1558.0, 261.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8446331024169922, "coordinate": [533, 400, 1453, 464], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[533.0, 400.0], [1453.0, 400.0], [1453.0, 464.0], [533.0, 464.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8445923924446106, "coordinate": [534, 499, 1828, 564], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 499.0], [1828.0, 499.0], [1828.0, 564.0], [534.0, 564.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8093742728233337, "coordinate": [401, 600, 1328, 663], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[401.0, 600.0], [1328.0, 600.0], [1328.0, 663.0], [401.0, 663.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6619399189949036, "coordinate": [469, 702, 751, 762], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[469.0, 702.0], [751.0, 702.0], [751.0, 762.0], [469.0, 762.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9378238320350647, "coordinate": [534, 800, 2082, 1066], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 800.0], [2082.0, 800.0], [2082.0, 1066.0], [534.0, 1066.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8173746466636658, "coordinate": [536, 1102, 946, 1161], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[536.0, 1102.0], [946.0, 1102.0], [946.0, 1161.0], [536.0, 1161.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8550688028335571, "coordinate": [589, 1201, 1845, 1262], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[589.0, 1201.0], [1845.0, 1201.0], [1845.0, 1262.0], [589.0, 1262.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8515674471855164, "coordinate": [593, 1301, 1745, 1364], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[593.0, 1301.0], [1745.0, 1301.0], [1745.0, 1364.0], [593.0, 1364.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8163132667541504, "coordinate": [596, 1403, 1367, 1463], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[596.0, 1403.0], [1367.0, 1403.0], [1367.0, 1463.0], [596.0, 1463.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6758637428283691, "coordinate": [470, 1501, 1001, 1562], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[470.0, 1501.0], [1001.0, 1501.0], [1001.0, 1562.0], [470.0, 1562.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7971090078353882, "coordinate": [531, 1602, 997, 1662], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[531.0, 1602.0], [997.0, 1602.0], [997.0, 1662.0], [531.0, 1662.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8233340382575989, "coordinate": [534, 1701, 1553, 1764], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 1701.0], [1553.0, 1701.0], [1553.0, 1764.0], [534.0, 1764.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8226385116577148, "coordinate": [535, 1801, 1601, 1866], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[535.0, 1801.0], [1601.0, 1801.0], [1601.0, 1866.0], [535.0, 1866.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7920048236846924, "coordinate": [533, 1901, 1094, 1963], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[533.0, 1901.0], [1094.0, 1901.0], [1094.0, 1963.0], [533.0, 1963.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7041003704071045, "coordinate": [471, 2001, 752, 2063], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[471.0, 2001.0], [752.0, 2001.0], [752.0, 2063.0], [471.0, 2063.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.926680326461792, "coordinate": [534, 2101, 2081, 2264], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 2101.0], [2081.0, 2101.0], [2081.0, 2264.0], [534.0, 2264.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6672907471656799, "coordinate": [537, 2301, 1124, 2363], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[537.0, 2301.0], [1124.0, 2301.0], [1124.0, 2363.0], [537.0, 2363.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6907593607902527, "coordinate": [591, 2403, 1754, 2464], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[591.0, 2403.0], [1754.0, 2403.0], [1754.0, 2464.0], [591.0, 2464.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8587818145751953, "coordinate": [535, 2501, 1602, 2564], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[535.0, 2501.0], [1602.0, 2501.0], [1602.0, 2564.0], [535.0, 2564.0]]}, {"cls_id": 21, "label": "table", "score": 0.9580687880516052, "coordinate": [360, 2595, 2071, 2947], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[360.0, 2595.0], [2071.0, 2595.0], [2071.0, 2947.0], [360.0, 2947.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7538710236549377, "coordinate": [2100, 3188, 2198, 3232], "order": 20, "polygon_points": [[2100.0, 3188.0], [2198.0, 3188.0], [2198.0, 3232.0], [2100.0, 3232.0]]}]}}